    {
      "id": "73ed9241-ebc2-48e7-952b-02871f912ef5",
      "name": "Sticky Note 375b5d0d",
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## Share n8n Workflows on GitHub (v2)\nPublishes every workflow tagged **share** (Config → tag) to the public repo as `<name>_<id>.json`.\n\n- Exported JSON is sanitized: no pinData, staticData, sharing/version metadata or credential IDs\n- Files of workflows that lost the tag (or were archived/deleted) are removed\n- Aborts instead of deleting when no shared workflows are found or more than `maxDeletes` files would go\n- Only a 404 on the folder counts as \"empty repo\"; every other GitHub error fails the run → ErrorWorkflow\n\n**Do not run in parallel with the old \"Share n8n Workflows on GitHub\"** – both manage `workflows/` and would delete each other's files.",
        "height": 432,
        "width": 400
      },
